  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Play]\r\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u
    h\u1ED3i ta, gi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng minh, r\u1ED3i h\u1ED3i sinh h\u1ECD."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 Thi\xEAn Linh C\xE1i \u2014 t\xEAn g\u1ECDi g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi
    t\xE0 thu\u1EADt luy\u1EC7n linh h\u1ED3n trong chuy\u1EC7n truy\u1EC1n mi\u1EC7ng
    ph\u01B0\u01A1ng Nam. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EDDi k\u1EC3 k\u1EBB luy\u1EC7n
    d\xF9ng v\u1EADt ch\u1EE9a t\u1EEB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 sai
    khi\u1EBFn vong, c\u1EA7u l\u1EE3i r\u1ED3i chu\u1ED1c qu\u1EA3 b\xE1o."
